        {
          "ruleId": "OPENVAS-CGI-Scanning-Consolidation",
          "ruleIndex": 4,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "The script consolidates various information for CGI scanning.\nThis information is based on the following scripts / settings:\n- HTTP-Version Detection (OID: 1.3.6.1.4.1.25623.1.0.100034)\n- No 404 check (OID: 1.3.6.1.4.1.25623.1.0.10386)\n- Web mirroring / webmirror.nasl (OID: 1.3.6.1.4.1.25623.1.0.10662)\n- Directory Scanner / DDI_Directory_Scanner.nasl (OID: 1.3.6.1.4.1.25623.1.0.11032)\n- The configured 'cgi_path' within the 'Scanner Preferences' of the scan config in use\n- The configured 'Enable CGI scanning', 'Enable generic web application scanning' and 'Add historic /scripts and /cgi-bin to directories for CGI scanning' within the 'Global variable settings' of the scan config in use\nIf you think any of this information is wrong please report it to the referenced community portal."
          },
          "properties": {
            "severity": "LOG",
            "cvss": 0.0,
            "source": "OPENVAS",
            "port": 443,
            "protocol": "tcp"
          },
